+/*
+ * volcano: nobody looks at the panel during an unattended boot. Print the
+ * panel memory to the console, downscaled by SCALE (block average) as RGB444,
+ * rows as "SHOT y x0 rgbrgb..." (64 pixels a line). tools/shot2png.py turns the ramoops
