+/*
+ * RPMh: n (<= 14) WRITE commands (cmd-db address, data) through the APPS RSC drv-2 ACTIVE TCS 0, waiting
+ * for completion. Same sequence as w_rpmh_vote. Shared by TopazModem's callers via rpmh_lock.
